            "paragraph": "Despite the large biases in both forest and open area albedos by some schemes in some months and years, the mean \u2206\u03b1 RF bias over the 3-year period (November\u2013May) was considerably small across models (\u22122.1 \u00b1 1.04 Wm\u22122; 21 \u00b1 11 %); four of six models had normalized mean absolute errors less than 20 %. Identifying systematic sources of the albedo prediction biases proved challenging, although for some schemes clear sources were identified.",
